OTOGAKURE TECHNIQUE REFERENCE
DISTRIBUTION: GENERAL (OPERATIVE)
Scroll Ref: KJ-SN-003

SUBJECT: Serpent Summoning and Snake Ninjutsu

The serpent is the emblem of our village and the signature of our founder. The following
techniques are standard issue to trained Sound operatives.

Summoning
- Summoning Jutsu (Snakes): requires a blood contract. Summons range from field-scale
  serpents to the great Manda, who answers only to those he deems worthy and demands
  tribute for his aid.
- Do not summon Manda casually. He will turn on a summoner who wastes his time.

Core Techniques
- Hidden Shadow Snake Hands (Sen'eijashu): serpents strike from the sleeve to bind or
  envenom at close range.
- Many Hidden Shadow Snakes (Sen'eitajashu): a wide-area variant loosing dozens at once.
- Soft Physical Body Replacement: the practitioner sheds a serpentine husk to escape a
  killing blow — a hallmark of Lord Orochimaru's survivability.

Venom Discipline
Envenomed strikes are for capture and interrogation as often as for killing. Antivenom
is stocked at every compound medic station. Log all venom draws.
